      "title": {
        "en": "Differing experiences with clinic staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers speak warmly of Dr Smith, Alexandra, and the reception team, noting their accommodating attitudes during wellness visits and routine ear treatments. Conversely, several clients experienced dismissive behaviour and unhelpful communication when seeking care for sick animals. Pet parents advise confirming which veterinarian will oversee ongoing treatments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Varied communication and follow-up support"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate practitioners who explain diagnostic procedures clearly and adapt treatment plans to owner budgets. However, multiple reviewers express frustration with unreturned telephone messages, delays in medication adjustments, and lack of guidance following tests. Clients recommend requesting clear timelines for diagnostic results and callbacks."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed views regarding treatment fees"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several clients highlight fair pricing for routine checkups and value wellness membership plans that waive initial examination fees. In contrast, other pet owners report shock at high quotes for emergency testing and checkup fees charged without follow-up treatment. Reviewers recommend asking for an itemised cost estimate before agreeing to diagnostics."
      }
    }
  ],
